                  <h2>What Are Integrated Oncology Services?</h2>
                  <p>Integrated oncology means that every service a cancer patient needs is connected within one coordinated plan, rather than scattered across different buildings and doctors who never talk to each other. Not every service has to sit under one roof, but they must work as one team.</p>
